[00:20.08] She wore red dresses
[00:25.04] With her black shining hair
[00:29.08] She had my baby
[00:34.04] And caused me to care
[00:39.04] Then coldly she left me
[00:44.09] To suffer and cry
[00:49.09] 'Cause, She wore red dresses
[00:54.05] And told such sweet lies
[00:59.12] 
[01:19.04] I never knew him
[01:24.01] But he took her away
[01:29.03] And on my knees like a madman
[01:34.06] For vengeance I prayed
[01:39.05] While the pain and the anger
[01:44.05] Destroyed my weak mind
[01:49.00] She wore red dresses
[01:53.06] And left the wounded behind
[01:58.63] 
[02:19.00] I searched til I found them,
[02:23.09] Then I cursed at the sight
[02:28.06] Of their sleeping shadows
[02:33.08] In the cold neon light
[02:38.07] In the dark morning silence
[02:43.02] I placed the gun to her head
[02:48.02] 'Cause, She wore red dresses,
[02:53.07] But now she lay dead...
[02:56.76] 